.\" M4KK1 4P1 - groups.db.5
.TH GROUPS.DB 5 "2026-07-22" "M4KK1 1.0" "M4KK1 Configuration Files"
.SH NAME
groups.db \- M4KK1 group database
.SH DESCRIPTION
/export/cfg/groups.db contains system group information. Each line has colon-separated fields:
.TP
.B groupname
Group name
.TP
.B gid
Group ID
.TP
.B members
Comma-separated member list
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
prime:1001:root,testuser
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR passwd.db (5),
.BR login.conf (5)
